# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# All routes not matching a static file are served dist/404.html (which is a
# copy of index.html built at deploy time). This lets client-side routing
# (wouter) handle the URL after the JS boots.
#
# NOTE: "/* /index.html 200" is intentionally NOT used here — Cloudflare Pages
# silently ignores it when 404.html exists and triggers an infinite-loop
# detection warning. The 404.html approach is the correct CF Pages SPA pattern.
#
# For Render static sites or other hosts that don't use 404.html, uncomment:
# /* /index.html 200
